Lesson Introduction GitHub Copilot is an AI-powered coding assistant that can work directly inside development environments such as Visual Studio Code.

5
00:00:17.595 --> 00:00:28.491
It can help developers generate code, explain code, understand errors, suggest improvements, create tests, and assist with larger development tasks.

6
