24
00:01:30.910 --> 00:01:33.288
What Is an IDE?

25
00:01:33.288 --> 00:01:42.269
IDE means: Integrated Development Environment It is software used to write, edit, test, debug, and manage code.

26
00:01:42.269 --> 00:01:48.682
Visual Studio Code is widely used by developers and can support AI coding tools.

27
00:01:48.682 --> 00:01:59.239
Code Suggestions function calculateTotal(price, quantity) { return price * quantity; } A suggestion is not proof that the code is correct.

28
00:01:59.239 --> 00:02:02.499
The developer must review and test it.

29
